rooms_desc ({"WELCOME","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","Ez a szoba Tomcat kedvenc szobaja.Ide vonul vissza pihenni, olvasgatni, gondolkozni, mudozni.A szobaban mindenhol parnak vannak. Barhol el lehet kenyelmesen helyezkedni.Egy hullamos papagaj is van a szobaban. Csiripelesevel jol kiegesziti a hi-fi torony zenejet. A deli oldalon egy szamitogep duruzsol. A gep folottegy kep log.A nyugati oldalon egy nagy ablak van. Csodalatos kilatas nyilik a tajra:  A barsonyos, viragos, zold mezon egy unicorn jatszadozik (mar csak a balu  hianyzik). A ret mogott egy baratsagos erdot latsz. Az erdo mellett egy   vizese van. A vizcseppek szivarvanyt varazsolnak kore.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,})
